{"code":0,"message":"SUCCESS","data":{"tab_index":0,"tab_item":[{"tab_type":8,"client_tab_type":0,"title":"找剧","cell_data":[{"cell_id":6952850996422770718,"show_type":401,"cell_name":"","cell_operation_type":1,"use_recommend":true,"cell_abstract":"","cell_id_str":"6952850996422770718","cell_data":[{"cell_id":6952850996422770718,"show_type":402,"cell_name":"小卡","cell_operation_type":0,"use_recommend":false,"video_data":[{"vid":"7664156268113710104","cover":"https://p3-reading-sign.fqnovelpic.com/novel-pic/f25bc26196dcaa59d9e4892c33e265ca~tplv-81nmtwyey9-superreso-aifit:400:0.image?lk3s=ae45642e&x-expires=1799163126&x-signature=vtfD3Per%2FoBlifWpDGRJaGiNgrw%3D","duration":6256,"title":"仙骨被挖，我无敌了","video_desc":"凌臣过马路时看小说，被货车撞死，魂穿小说世界，成为修真界最强，但遭遇疼爱的小师妹下药，污蔑，挖去仙骨的宗门大师兄。凌臣穿越过来之后，面对恋爱脑小师妹，绿茶小师弟，心软四师妹，扶弟魔三师妹，自私自利二师妹，和野心勃勃大师妹，凌臣露出冷笑。凌臣，想死？哪有这么容易，我要让你们求生不得求死不能。","series_id":"7664154316441144344","episode":true,"vertical":true,"content_type":1,"recommend_info":"{\"channel_id\":\"94349560332\",\"request_id\":\"20261106233205711C9EB692B7CDA329C4\",\"rank\":\"2\",\"queue_names\":\"shortplay\",\"final_queue_name\":\"heji\",\"gid\":\"7664154316441144344\",\"plan_id\":\"1\",\"is_show_ad_flag\":\"0\",\"series_pred_score\":\"{\\\"normalized_duration\\\":0.7431368827819824,\\\"like\\\":0.052618950605392456,\\\"finish\\\":0.0028009277302771807,\\\"collect\\\":0.039048295468091965,\\\"stream_ctr\\\":0.0460207536816597,\\\"staytime_stream\\\":1.1719599962234497,\\\"absolute_staytime\\\":0.1474800407886505}\"}","recommend_group_id":"7664154316441144344","play_cnt":123039,"book_exist":false,"copyright":"阅益短剧","sub_title":"玄幻·玄幻仙侠","score":"8.2","use_video_model":true,"episode_cnt":80,"video_platform":3,"disable_play":false,"category_schema":"[{\"category_id\":5008,\"name\":\"玄幻\",\"schema\":\"dragon8662://categorySearch?categoryId=5008&categoryName=玄幻&genreType=130&gender=1&source=detail\"},{\"category_id\":5072,\"name\":\"玄幻仙侠\",\"schema\":\"dragon8662://categorySearch?categoryId=5072&cate